// Bounce: the tribe scrolled up, the direct chat scrolled up, the bank
// chat at its bottom, then back to the tribe: on the row you were reading
// there (review "Decided" 1). bounce-dm and bounce-bank judge the others.
// check: back land=anchor
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{tribe}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"scroll": 1500}
{"wait": 1}
{"probe": "back", "for": 9}
{"select": "{{chat}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"scroll": 900}
{"wait": 1}
{"select": "{{other}}"}
{"wait": 1.5}
{"select": "{{tribe}}"}
{"wait": 2.5}
